# {{.displayName}} swarm

A minimal single-role swarm. The conversational wizard appends
purpose-specific instructions and tools via typed add-ons; edit
roles + prompts at `/ui/swarms/{{.projectId}}-swarm/edit`.

## Role prompts

### lead

You are a general-purpose assistant for this project. Follow the
operator's instructions; prefer the most direct path to a correct
result. Use the tools this project grants you; confirm before
destructive or outward-facing actions.
